## TiDB Configuration (Production)
SPRING_DATASOURCE_URL=jdbc:mysql://your-tidb-cluster.tidbcloud.com:4000/incidentdb?useSSL=true&requireSecureTransport=true&serverTimezone=UTC
SPRING_DATASOURCE_USERNAME=your-tidb-username
SPRING_DATASOURCE_PASSWORD=your-tidb-password

## JWT Configuration
JWT_SECRET=your-secure-random-secret-key-here

## Spring Profile
SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=dev
